    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29299" root="عصد" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصَوَّدٌ</span></b>  A <i>long</i> day: (IAar, K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطَوَّدٌ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطَرَّدٌ</span>. (L in arts. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عطد</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عطرد</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
all signify A <i>high</i> mountain. (L in arts. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عطد</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عطرد</span>.)

